    {
      "type": "LinguisticObject",
      "content": "Monogrammed recto, bottom-left, on background, in red paint: \"M\".\n\nInscribed verso: \"Hermann Dudley Murphy / 18 M 96 / Portrait of / Henry Ossawa Tanner / Salon of the / Champs de Mars 1896\".",
